  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 envelope (1 tablespoon) unflavored gelatin",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1.25 cups milk",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1.3333333730698 cups flaked coconut",
    "2 cups heavy cream",
    "1 (10 ounce) package frozen raspberries, thawed",
    "1 tablespoon cold water",
    "2 teaspoons cornstarch"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Stir sugar, gelatin, and salt together in a medium saucepan. Add milk; cook and stir over medium heat until gelatin is dissolved. Remove from heat and chill until partially set.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w8xufNmNa5wOoyKkz80bUMzKFvE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27020-jell-o-snow-pudding-VAT-step-01-7936d7e906c14f8dbbe00c7de64f7d03.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27020/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir once and add vanilla. Fold in coconut and heavy cream.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BGEo3FGEFOBCb-6yLHAn2c4yCpQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27020-jell-o-snow-pudding-VAT-step-02-519951288bcb49f3850ae4857a2597a4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27020/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into a pudding mold. Chill until firm, about 4 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fe_MYmpX0uLVko3tEyF03zWoTSs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27020-jell-o-snow-pudding-VAT-step-03-c22bc811985b4fa381928d0556985fe6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27020/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make raspberry sauce: Pour raspberries with juice, into a medium saucepan. Cook over medium heat until boiling. Mix together water and cornstarch; stir into the raspberries. Boil rapidly for one minute, stirring constantly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
